{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12169","headline":"登覆釜山遇道人二首 二 · 钱起","name":"登覆釜山遇道人二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真气重嶂里，知君嘉遯幽。\n山堦压丹穴，药井通洑流。\n道者带经出，洞中携我游。\n欲骖白蜺去，且爲紫芝留。\n忽忆武陵事，别家疑数秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}